=== 0. WHAT WAS ALREADY DONE (fix wave R7g, PARTIAL) ==========================
Producer recorded sha256(16)+bytes for exactly the paths listed in example.json `assets`.
Consumer (spec-compliance-audit S15) verified existence, non-zero, and agreement with that record.
Open question this session answered: is the *declared list* itself trustworthy as the binding scope?
Answer: no — measured below.

